# Downloaded character models are not committed.
#
# Binary assets bloat git history permanently and a fresh clone should not have to pull megabytes
# to run the game. tools/fetch-models.mjs downloads them, and the client falls back to procedural
# figures when they are absent.
*.glb
*.gltf
*.bin

# Credits are regenerated by the script alongside the downloads.
CREDITS.md

# Keep the directory itself in the repository so the path exists on a fresh clone.
!.gitignore
